    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the estates, powers and trusts law and the surrogate's court procedure act, in relation to making technical corrections related to marriage equality",
    "basePrintNo": "S262",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S262-2017",
    "coSponsors": {
